  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Poll Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What are some funny poll questions?\", \"a\": \"Here are five funny poll questions that pick on no one. Is a hot dog a sandwich? Pineapple on pizza: yes or no? Socks with sandals: crime or comfort? Would you rather lose your keys or your phone charger? Is cereal a soup? Before you post one, try your funniest poll questions on two friends and keep the ones that get an answer straight away.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create poll questions?\", \"a\": \"Write one question with two to five answers, decide who may vote and when the poll closes, then share the link. In Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder'>AI survey builder</a>, you describe the poll in a sentence, and Emergent builds a voting page you can share by link. A follow-up prompt changes the question, the answers, or the closing time.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some fun questions to ask in a group poll?\", \"a\": \"Ask questions every member can answer without a debate. Pizza or tacos for the next get-together? Which decade had the best music? Beach week or mountain week? Early bird or night owl? Group poll questions like these are quick to answer, and some of them settle a real plan, such as where to eat next time.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some good poll questions?\", \"a\": \"Good poll questions ask about one thing and offer answers people can pick at a glance. Which day works best for the team lunch? Which of these four outings gets your vote? Was today's meeting too long or about right? Multiple choice poll questions like these end with a clear count. When you need details, such as where a repair is needed, use a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/work-order'>work order form</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some fun poll questions I can ask my friends?\", \"a\": \"Try these fun poll questions with friends. Would you rather explore space or the deep sea? What is the best road trip snack? Which movie deserves a rewatch? Cats or dogs? Save anything that splits the group, like money or politics, for a real conversation, and keep your poll questions for fun light.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some poll questions?\", \"a\": \"Poll questions come in a few types. This or that: Mountains or ocean? Multiple choice: Which board game goes on the shelf next? Rating: Rate this week's all-hands, 1 for wasted time and 5 for time well spent. Open: What name fits the new conference room? For a busy channel, this or that poll questions make the easiest poll of the day questions.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are good would you rather poll questions?\", \"a\": \"Good would you rather poll questions offer two choices that are equally tempting or equally annoying. Would you rather give up coffee or dessert for a month? Would you rather always arrive 10 minutes early or 10 minutes late? Would you rather work a week from a beach or from a cabin? Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing a poll like this.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where should a website place opinion poll questions?\", \"a\": \"Place an opinion poll where readers have formed a view: at the end of an article, beside the topic it asks about, or on the page people see after they finish a task. Ask one question per poll. Show the results only after a vote, and keep the poll away from the content people came to read.\"}, {\"q\": \"Which poll questions are allowed in a work chat?\", \"a\": \"Questions anyone can answer without sharing something private are fine: lunch spots, weekend plans, and this-or-that choices. Aim funny poll questions for work at shared work life, such as Monday mornings or the printer, never at a coworker. Leave out politics, religion, health, and pay. Keep fun poll questions for work optional.\"}, {\"q\": \"How can a business make poll questions profitable?\", \"a\": \"Tie each poll to a decision that costs or earns money. Ask customers which flavor to stock next or which delivery day suits them, act on the winner, and compare sales before and after. Build the poll app with Emergent, and it can send each vote to a tool you already use, such as your CRM, through its API.\"}]}; </script></div></div>",
  "alpb---prompt": "<p>Build a set of poll questions that collects every answer in a database I own.</p><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbPrompt = {\"default\": \"Build a set of poll questions that collects every answer in a database I own.\", \"chips\": [{\"label\": \"Poll of the Day\", \"add\": \"Add a poll of the day that posts one this-or-that question to Slack each morning.\"}, {\"label\": \"Multiple Choice\", \"add\": \"Add a multiple choice poll that takes one vote per person on the staff list.\"}, {\"label\": \"Live Audience Poll\", \"add\": \"Add a live audience poll whose results update on the presenter screen as votes arrive.\"}, {\"label\": \"Would You Rather\", \"add\": \"Add a would you rather poll with an email reminder for anyone who has not voted.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}